<statement>
<p>What is the solution to <m>\displaystyle{9}{x}+{9}={6}{x}+{15}</m>? <fillin characters="3"/>   </p>


</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>2</li></ul></p>
</answer>
<solution><p><m>\displaystyle{9}{x}+{9}={6}{x}+{15}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{9}{x}+{9}-{15}={6}{x}+{15}-{15}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{9}{x}-{6}={6}{x}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{9}{x}-{6}-{9}{x}={6}{x}-{9}{x}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle-{6}=-{3}{x}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle-\frac{{6}}{{-{{3}}}}=\frac{{-{3}{x}}}{{-{{3}}}}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{2}={x}</m>.</p>
</solution>
</myopenmath>